silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_04_initial_algebra_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "InitialAlgebraYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_04_initial_algebra_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'InitialAlgebraYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Initial Sigma-Algebra', the catamorphism_arrow cata(colimit_structure): PublishTreeType -> MittensColimitApex is the unique Sigma-algebra homomorphism; not monic because multiple distinct trees in PublishTreeType may fold to the same element of MittensColimitApex (different publish paths can produce the same colimit element)." .
